id: pm-review-help-ux
title: Fix repeated extension value placeholders and duplicate help flags
description: Bare flag names let the host append one typed placeholder and suppress residual extension flags. Packed npm and native Bun help regressions prove the package declaration fix.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
