parent: pm-review-epic
resolution: "Delivered by https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/pull/8 (merge 7ac4a21c1865, head e0082b767cf5)"
expected_result: "Delivered by the linked pull request, merged after its head check gate passed."
actual_result: "Merged at 2026-10-14T05:24:22Z; no readable required checks, so every completed head check run had to succeed, be neutral or be skipped; successful checks: CodeQL, CodeRabbit, Sourcery review, codeql, cubic · AI code reviewer, test (22), test (26)"
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-14T04:34:59.078Z",codex-agent,"Root cause is the package declaration: long names contained literal <value> while the host appends its own placeholder from type:string. The host also compares long names to registered option names to suppress residual flag help, so the malformed name caused the second listing. Use bare --repo, --pr, --reason and --commit. Packed npm and native Bun acceptance assert one placeholder and one option listing."
  "2026-10-14T04:42:28.089Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof: replace only registerReviewCommands with origin/main and rebuild. Packed acceptance fails on --reason <value> <value> and the repeated Extension-provided flags section. Restore the function and rebuild: npm/npx and native Bun/bunx packed acceptance passes 1/1."
  "2026-10-14T04:54:42.358Z",codex-agent,"Final validation: npm run test:install passed 1/1 via pm test --run --progress, covering packed npm/npx and native Bun/bunx consumers. Both isolated npm and Bun release gates also passed 99/99 unit/tooling tests and 1/1 packed acceptance. No host defect remains for these two help symptoms; the package declaration fixes both."
  "2026-10-14T06:16:29.664Z",pi-agent,The package pins @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.10.13. Host placeholder duplication is fixed upstream in 2026.10.14 (GH-1461); the dependency bump remains with Dependabot.
